...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

pipeline: 계획 파이프라인 (PlanningPipeline) { class: ours }
visual_assessor: 시각 분석 에이전트 (VisualAssessor) { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API (gemini-3-flash-preview) { class: ext }

pipeline -> visual_assessor: 호출 (1단계, SequentialAgent)
visual_assessor -> gemini: instruction + 도구 선언 + 사진
gemini -> visual_assessor: function_call SearchAgent(query) + estimate_renovation_cost(...)
